==English==

===Etymology===
Blend of {{blend|en|thyratron|transistor}}. First attested {{C|1965}} as an alternative name for the {{w|Silicon Controlled Rectifier}} (SCR) developed in the late 1950s.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɪstə(r)}}

===Noun===
